# INVWINBK.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:BACK.CFG, a settings file that is not there: ESC back to the
# tree on the row left.  From Box B2, the tree's third row, Admin >
# Users and ESC: Box B2 is selected again with its contents.  F6, and
# Record > Parts of item 2 in the contents: ESC shows the tree on Box B2
# with the focus in the contents, on item 2; the users and ESC from
# there leave both so.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINBK.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B DOWN DOWN
S TREE
K ALT-A U
K ESC
S TREEBACK
K F6 ALT-C P
S TPARTS
K ESC
S TREEPANE
K ALT-A U
K ESC
S TREEUSER
K ALT-F X
